    "date": 1764342000,
    "caption": "💸 Want to scale your startup and attract investment? WeVenture helps women founders do it faster.\n\n📊 The new 12-week WeVenture accelerator has officially launched in Kazakhstan.\n\nThe program offers:\n• Education & training — strategic thinking, leadership, and resilience\n• Mentorship & skills — business modeling, financial planning, pitch preparation, and investor relations\n• Product testing — take your idea to MVP with real user feedback\n• Networking & community — meetings with entrepreneurs, investors, and ecosystem partners\n• Pitching, Demo Days & competition — preparation for presentations and an opportunity to receive a grant for business growth\n\n👩 The program supports women founders in improving their investment readiness and scale their business to local, regional, and international markets.\n\nApply if your startup:\n• Has 51%+ female ownership or a key woman in leadership role\n• Is an existing or planned business in Kazakhstan\n• Has been operating for no more than 7 years\n• Offers an innovative product or service\n• Has potential for scaling\n\n📅 Application deadline: December 1, 2025\n\n🔗 Apply via the link in our profile under the “Programs” section.",
